<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Redirection… - AlloStage</title>
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body {
            font-family: 'Poppins', 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #eff6ff 0%, #dbeafe 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .popup-acces {
            background: #fff;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 36px 32px;
            max-width: 420px;
            width: 100%;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px -15px rgba(30, 58, 138, 0.25);
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            animation: pop-in 0.35s ease;
        }
        @keyframes pop-in {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.92) translateY(10px); }
            to   { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1) translateY(0); }
        }
        .icone-acces {
            width: 64px;
            height: 64px;
            margin: 0 auto 18px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fef3c7, #fde68a);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 30px;
        }
        .popup-acces h2 {
            font-size: 20px;
            color: #0f172a;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .popup-acces p {
            color: #64748b;
            font-size: 14.5px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 22px;
        }
        .barre-progres {
            width: 100%;
            height: 4px;
            background: #e2e8f0;
            border-radius: 4px;
            overflow: hidden;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }
        .barre-progres-fill {
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #3b82f6, #1e3a8a);
            width: 0;
            animation: avancer 2.5s linear forwards;
        }
        @keyframes avancer { to { width: 100%; } }
        .btn-retour {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3a8a, #3b82f6);
            color: #fff;
            padding: 10px 24px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 14px;
            transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
        }
        .btn-retour:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px -4px rgba(30, 58, 138, 0.4);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="popup-acces">
    <div class="icone-acces">🔒</div>
    <h2>Accès non autorisé</h2>
    <p>
        Vous n'avez pas les permissions nécessaires pour accéder à cette page.<br>
        Redirection en cours…
    </p>
    <div class="barre-progres">
        <div class="barre-progres-fill"></div>
    </div>
    <a href="{{ retour|default('index.php') }}" class="btn-retour">Retour à l'accueil</a>
</div>

<script>
    setTimeout(() => {
        window.location.href = {{ retour|default('index.php')|json_encode|raw }};
    }, 2500);
</script>

</body>
</html>
